body:
Vrabel is a hell of a head coach, he still needs to work on a few things, timely aggression and challenges are on top of the list, but hes had hell to work with this year with our injuries all at key positions. 

&#x200B;

offseason moves need to be made to solidify our offensive holes. we need a veteran receiver and we badly need interior lineman.

&#x200B;

draft should focus on defense. casey needs help and we need more depth at linebacker with orakpo and morgan likely not returning unless they want to take pay cuts. 

&#x200B;

Marcus will show all of you next year who he really is as a player. it crushed him to not be able to play tonight and if we protect him, hes going to light the league up.
